cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this pipeline, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Butterfly Phylogenomics Pipeline"
abstract: >
  A fully reproducible end-to-end phylogenetic analysis pipeline for 20 butterfly
  species using four mitochondrial protein-coding genes (COI, COII, CytB, ND5).
  Includes automated NCBI data collection, MAFFT alignment, IQ-TREE ML phylogeny,
  genetic distance analysis, and publication-quality visualisation.
